L["A strike that deals 125% weapon damage and increases your chance to dodge by 15% for 7 sec. Awards 1 combo point."] = "对敌人造成125%的武器伤害，并使你躲闪攻击的几率提高15%，持续7秒。奖励1个连击点数。"
L["Adds a chill effect to your Blizzard spell. This effect lowers the target's movement speed by 30%. Lasts 1.50 sec."] = "为你的暴风雪法术增加冰冷效果，使目标的移动速度降低30%,持续1.50秒。"
