L["Assault the target's mind with Shadow energy, causing 75 Shadow damage over 3 sec and slowing their movement speed by 50%."] = "以暗影能量攻击目标的灵魂，在3秒内对其造成总计75点暗影伤害，并使其移动速度降低50%。"
L["Assume a Shadowform, increasing your Shadow damage by 15% and reducing Physical damage done to you by 15%. However, you may not cast Holy spells while in this form."] = "进入暗影形态，使你的暗影伤害提高15%，受到的物理伤害降低15%。但是在这种形态下，你不能施放神圣法术。"
L["Causes all enemies near the warrior to be dazed, reducing movement speed by 50% for 6 sec."] = "使战士身边的所有敌人眩晕，移动速度降低50%，持续6秒。"
