L["Silences the target, preventing them from casting spells for 5 sec."] = "使目标沉默，在5秒内不能施法。"
L["Stuns the opponent for 5 sec."] = "野蛮的攻击，令目标昏迷5秒。"
L["Summons a Mana Tide Totem with 5 health at the feet of the caster for 12 sec that restores 170 mana every 3 seconds to group members within 20 yards."] = "在施法者身边召唤一个生命值为5点的法力之潮图腾，持续12秒。它可以为半径20码范围内的小队成员每3秒回复170点法力值。"
L["The Berserker Rage ability will generate 5 rage when used."] = "在使用狂暴之怒技能之后获得5点怒气值。"
L["The enemy target is swarmed by insects, decreasing their chance to hit by 2% and causing 66 Nature damage over 12 sec."] = "敌人被飞虫围绕，攻击命中率降低2%，在12秒内受到总计66点自然伤害。"
L["Transfers 15 health from the target to the caster every 3 sec. Lasts 30 sec."] = "每3秒将目标的15点生命值转移给施法者，持续30秒。"
L["Upon death, the priest becomes the Spirit of Redemption for 10 sec. The Spirit of Redemption cannot move, attack, be attacked or targeted by any spells or effects. While in this form the priest can cast any healing spell free of cost. When the effect ends, the priest dies."] = "在死亡时，牧师变成一个救赎之魂，持续10秒。救赎之魂无法移动、攻击，也不会受到任何法术或效果的影响。在这个形态下，牧师可以施放任何治疗法术，不需消耗任何法力值。当救赎之魂效果结束时，牧师死亡。"
L["When activated, gives your next Flash of Light, Holy Light, or Holy Shock spell a 100% critical effect chance."] = "激活之后，使你的下一个圣光闪现、圣光术或神圣震击有100%的几率造成极效治疗效果。"
L["When activated, increases the critical strike chance of your next Sinister Strike, Backstab, Ambush, or Eviscerate by 100%."] = "激活之后，你的下一次邪恶攻击、背刺、伏击或刺骨造成爆击的几率提高100%。"
L["When activated, increases your physical damage by 20% and makes you immune to Fear effects, but lowers your armor and all resistances by 20%. Lasts 30 sec."] = "激活之后，你的物理攻击伤害提高20%，并免疫恐惧效果，但是对所有攻击的防御力都降低20%。持续30秒。"
L["When activated, reduces the Mana cost of your next spell by 100% and increases its critical effect chance by 25% if it is capable of a critical effect."] = "激活之后，你的下一个法术所消耗的法力值减少100%，造成爆击或极效治疗的几率提高25%（如果它有可能造成这些效果的话）。"
L["When activated, this ability temporarily grants you 30% of your maximum hit points for 20 seconds. After the effect expires, the hit points are lost."] = "激活之后，使你暂时获得30%的生命值，持续20秒。在效果结束之后，这些生命值会被扣除。"
L["When activated, this spell causes each of your Fire damage spell hits to increase your critical strike chance with Fire damage spells by 10%. This effect lasts until you have caused 3 critical strikes with Fire spells."] = "激活之后，你每一次施放火焰系伤害性法术，你的该类法术的爆击几率都会提高10%。这个效果会一直持续到你使用火焰系法术造成了3次爆击。"
L["When activated, this spell finishes the cooldown on all of your Frost spells."] = "激活之后，使你的所有冰霜法术的冷却时间结束。"
L["When activated, your spells deal 30% more damage while costing 30% more mana to cast. This effect lasts 15 sec."] = "激活之后，你的法术会造成30%的额外伤害，但同时也要消耗30%的额外法力才能施放。这个效果可以持续15秒。"
L["When active, 30% of all damage taken by the caster is taken by your Imp, Voidwalker, Succubus, Incubus, or Felhunter demon instead. In addition, both the demon and master will inflict 3% more damage. Lasts as long as the demon is active."] = "激活之后，施法者所承受的伤害有30%被你的小鬼、虚空行者、魅魔、地狱猎犬、恶魔卫士等恶魔分担。另外，恶魔和其主人的任何攻击所造成的伤害都提高3%。只要恶魔保持激活状态，该效果就一直持续。"
L["When used, adds 2 combo points to your target. You must add to or use those combo points within 10 sec or the combo points are lost."] = "使用此技能后，为你的当前目标增加2个连击点数。你必须在10秒内消耗掉这些点数，或者为其增加新的连击点数，否则它们就会消失。"
L["While Aspect of the Hawk is active, all normal ranged attacks have a 1% chance of increasing ranged attack speed by 30% for 12 sec."] = "当雄鹰守护处于激活状态时，所有普通的远程攻击都有1%的几率使你的远程攻击速度提高30%，持续12秒。"
L["While affected by your Kidney Shot ability, the target receives an additional 3% damage from all sources."] = "目标受到你的肾击技能影响之后，任何攻击者对其所造成的伤害量都提高3%。"
L["While in Cat, Bear or Dire Bear Form, the Leader of the Pack increases ranged and melee critical chance of all party members within 45 yards by 3%."] = "在猎豹、熊或巨熊形态下，使半径45码范围内的所有小队成员的远程和近战攻击打出爆击的几率提高3%。"
L["While your pet is active, you and your pet will regenerate 1% of total health every 10 sec."] = "当你的宠物被激活后，你和你的宠物都会每10秒回复1%的生命值。"
L["You become encased in a block of ice, protecting you from all physical attacks and spells for 10 sec, but during that time you cannot attack, move or cast spells."] = "你被一道寒冰屏障所笼罩，在10秒内不会受到任何物理和法术伤害，但是在这期间你也无法攻击、移动或施法。"
L["You retain up to 5 of your rage points when you change stances."] = "在改变姿态的时候可以保留最多5点怒气值。"
L["Your Fire and Frost spell criticals will refund 10% of their base mana cost."] = "使你的火焰系和冰霜系法术在造成爆击效果之后为施法者回复该法术所消耗基础法力值的10%。"
L["Your Healing Wave spells have a 33% chance to increase the effect of subsequent Healing Wave spells on that target by 6% for 15 sec. This effect will stack up to 3 times."] = "你的治疗波有33%的几率令你的目标由以后的治疗波获得额外的治疗效果。这个效果使目标所受到的治疗效果提高6%，持续15秒，可叠加3次。"
L["Your Scorch spells have a 33% chance to cause your target to be vulnerable to Fire damage. This vulnerability increases the Fire damage dealt to your target by 3% and lasts 30 sec. Stacks up to 5 times."] = "使你的灼烧法术有33%的几率令目标更易受到火焰伤害，在其受到火焰系攻击时承受的伤害提高3%，持续30秒。可叠加5次。"
L["Your Shadow Bolt critical strikes increase Shadow damage dealt to the target by 4% until 4 non-periodic damage sources are applied. Effect lasts a maximum of 12 sec."] = "在你的暗影箭对目标造成爆击后，你对其造成的接连4次非持续性暗影伤害都将提高4%。效果持续最多12秒。"
L["Your Shadow damage spells have a 20% chance to cause your target to be vulnerable to Shadow damage. This vulnerability increases the Shadow damage dealt to your target by 3% and lasts 15 sec. Stacks up to 5 times."] = "你的暗影系伤害性法术有20%的机会使你的目标在受到暗影系攻击时更脆弱，受到的伤害提高3%，持续15秒。此效果最多可叠加5次。"
L["Your critical strikes cause the opponent to bleed, dealing 20% of your melee weapon's average damage over 12 sec."] = "你的爆击导致目标流血，使其在12秒内遭受相当于你的武器平均伤害值的20%的伤害。"
L["Your critical strikes from abilities that add combo points have a 20% chance to add an additional combo point."] = "如果你的某个可以增加连击点数的技能造成了爆击，那么它就有20%的几率增加一个额外的连击点数。"
L["Your next Imp, Voidwalker, Succubus, Incubus, or Felhunter Summon spell has its casting time reduced by 5.5 sec and its Mana cost reduced by 50%."] = "你的下一个召唤小鬼、虚空行者、魅魔、夜魔或地狱猎犬的法术施法时间减少5.5秒，法力消耗减少50%。"
L["Your offensive spell crits will increase your chance to get a critical strike with melee attacks by 3% for 10 sec."] = "使你的攻击性法术在造成爆击后，有一定几率令你的近战攻击爆击率提高3%，持续10秒。"
